[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=29 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="下午的空当，莫里在桌上摆出几只杯子，说你成天盯海图，可能该看看不用铅笔的队形。德雷顿过来凑热闹，手里端着真正要喝的水，被她要求先换个杯子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="别混。我好不容易把这几个缺口认熟，你一喝，等会儿我连自己的船在哪儿都找不到。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这是什么游戏？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="把同一队的杯子送到另一边，中间不能碰这几颗石子。两个人轮流挪，一人只能挪一次。先别问怎么赢，动一只看看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把最前的杯子移向空隙，莫里立刻把另一只横过来。你以为她在堵你，她说没有，她是在救后面那个，刚才如果只顾着冲出去，它就会被石子隔住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这是她自己加的规则。原版没有这么绕。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="原版也没有你上次把石子当糖吃。规矩都是吃过亏才长的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们玩了两轮，第一轮你只带出去两只，第二轮你索性不向前走，想等她先让。莫里看着你，伸手把靠边的杯子从桌上拿掉，说潮水可不会一直等。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你刚才没说有这个规则。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="对，所以这局我输。让你知道也可以指出我没说清的，不是我坐在这边，所有变出来的规矩就都算数。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把杯子摆回原位，认真补了一遍。德雷顿拿来一块小木牌记规则，写到第三条觉得太多，索性让莫里自己写。莫里接过去，写得歪，倒是一条也没漏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你是特意安排的？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="有一半。另一半是我真的忘了说。你要是想把我想成每一步都算好的老狐狸，我会少承认一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第三轮你们换边。莫里故意拿最慢的杯子，你却没有因为她熟游戏就随便冲。你问能不能先交换最初的顺序，她说可以，但会损失一次行动，让你自己判断划不划算。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那我愿意花这一回。后面转弯会少两次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="好。这回你说了成本，不是只说“我觉得这样比较好”。继续。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿在旁边快睡着，头一点一点。你们不约而同放轻杯子，越轻越容易觉得好笑，最后她被你们憋着的笑声吵醒，问是不是轮到自己被放上桌了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我要求重开。我刚才闭眼是在听，没看你们的手。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="杯子又没有声音。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="有。莫里要耍赖的时候会故意刮一下桌子，假装是自己不小心。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里把手放平，要求出示证据。德雷顿就学她挪杯子的样子，学得太像，连你都看出一模一样的停顿。莫里忍了一会儿，承认自己最多只刮过两次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="行，换你来。不过这回谁也不许因为他忘了以前的事，就替他挑容易的边。玩游戏输一次，不至于把人输回海里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你第一次很轻松地接受了这句话。输掉一局没有人急着安慰你，也没有人从胜负猜测你的来历。你只是问能不能再来一次，德雷顿把杯子推回起点，说当然，她还没输够。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我好像喜欢这种不用一直证明什么的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那你记一下，免得明天又说不知道自己喜欢什么。现在知道一件了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把这句话写在医生给的木片背面，不是因为它能恢复过去，只因为今天真的发生过。莫里瞥见，伸手把纸角压住，让被风吹起来的木牌别撞翻你刚摆好的杯子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

